# A cast an effect offers during a resolution is barred too when the card is in a barred zone (CR 101.2, 608.2g, 601.2a).
# Bot1 casts Avatar's Wrath turn 1. In turn 2 Bot2 casts Bloodbraid Challenger from its hand (allowed); its cascade
# (CR 702.85a) exiles a Mountain and then Lightning Bolt, but Bot2 can't cast the Bolt from exile, so it is never offered
# (`! Bot2.Accept`) and both go to the bottom of the library. In turn 4, the restriction over, a second Challenger's cascade
# exiles the next Lightning Bolt and Bot2 casts it at Bot1: the control.

